        </h2>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#2a3c54;line-height:1.73;margin:0 0 14px">This repair totaled $389.37. For an otherwise serviceable Samsung French-door refrigerator, that can be a sensible repair compared with replacing the entire unit, which can cost substantially more.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#2a3c54;line-height:1.73;margin:0">During this service call, the confirmed failure was the evaporator fan motor. Once that problem was corrected and normal cooling operation returned, there was no indication that a major sealed-system repair was required. The repair was completed in a single visit.</p>
      </div>

